---
// Konzept: Alert-E-Mail
---

<div class="flex size-full items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-brand-50/60 p-5 text-[12px] select-none sm:p-8">
  <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-elevated">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-100 px-4 py-3">
      <span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 ring-1 ring-red-600/15">!</span>
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate font-semibold text-ink-900">Kritischer Alert · USA</p>
        <p class="truncate text-[11px] text-slate-500">AboutExport Alerts · heute, 06:15</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 px-4 py-4">
      <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink-900">Neue Einträge auf der Entity List</p>
      <div class="space-y-1.5">
        <span class="block h-2 w-full rounded bg-slate-200"></span>
        <span class="block h-2 w-11/12 rounded bg-slate-200"></span>
        <span class="block h-2 w-2/3 rounded bg-slate-200"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
        <span class="rounded bg-red-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-red-700">Kritisch</span>
        <span class="rounded bg-brand-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-brand-700">USA</span>
        <span class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-600">Sanktionslisten</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2 pt-1">
        <span class="rounded-md bg-brand-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-white">Zusammenfassung lesen</span>
        <span class="rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-ink-900">Originalquelle</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
